  "description": "Provides real-time performance monitoring and profiling for TuanZi applications through MiniProfiler integration, featuring:\n\t\t\t- Request timing and execution profiling\n\t\t\t- SQL query monitoring and optimization\n\t\t\t- Custom timing blocks for critical operations\n\t\t\t- AJAX request performance tracking\n\t\t\t- Interactive profiling UI with call stacks\n\t\t\t- Database connection analysis\n\t\t\t- Performance bottleneck identification\n\t\t\t- Seamless integration with TuanZi diagnostic pipeline",
